    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Far Lobber.</strong> When you use the Attack action to throw a vial or flask, you can target an object or creature you can see within 40 feet of you.</p><p><strong>Long Shots.</strong> Attacking at long range doesn't impose Disadvantage on your attack rolls with Thrown weapons.</p>",
